Q: Can I do image orientation detection with HTML or CSS? A: <p><code>Object-fit: scale-down;</code> might you've been looking for.<br />
Check next:</p>
<p><div class="snippet" data-lang="js" data-hide="false" data-console="true" data-babel="false" data-babel-preset-react="false" data-babel-preset-ts="false">
<div class="snippet-code">
<pre class="snippet-code-css lang-css prettyprint-override"><code> figure {
  max-width: 90%;
 }
 img {
  max-width: 100%;
  max-height: 100vh;
  object-fit: scale-down;
 }</code></pre>
